  "contentHtml": "<p>원본 영상을 찍긴 했는데&#160;<br>클로드에게 이렇게 주문했어요.<br>영상에 약간의 소음 있으니, 음악으로 덮어주고, 중간중간 실험 방법 안내 문구 넣어줘 (몇 개 예시 들어줌.) 그리고 주의 사항도 넣어줘.</p><p>필요하면 잠깐 멈추고 자막 넣어줘. 라고 했더니 조금은 시간이 걸렸는데 그래도 괜찮네요.</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv092g90bjfk03d9l7d3fsmib?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv092g90bjfk03d9l7d3fsmib/thumbs/2.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33345691958&amp;kamp_tidx=0&amp;signature=dKr6TVCL0sEFuXPfoRS63CQE0do%3D&amp;ts=1788783158\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"1920\" data-video-origin-height=\"1080\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv092g90bjfk03d9l7d3fsmib?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2MDkyZzkwYmpmazAzZDlsN2QzZnNtaWIiLCJ0aWQiOiIwYzYzMmQ4Mi0xNzQyLTQ4MzQtYjhjMy1lZjNlZTBkMDk1ZmQiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkwMDgyNzN9.HuVtD_XnpcAy9jlNxGnDyc2CzXLYJVSKIbTvCwLj7JWTPVJFHX0LciaX8ZwazttJz2-ey0sJ_LisP4-GtQ9fIg&amp;autoplay=0&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2MDkyZzkwYmpmazAzZDlsN2QzZnNtaWIiLCJ0aWQiOiIwYzYzMmQ4Mi0xNzQyLTQ4MzQtYjhjMy1lZjNlZTBkMDk1ZmQiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODkwMDgyNzN9.HuVtD_XnpcAy9jlNxGnDyc2CzXLYJVSKIbTvCwLj7JWTPVJFHX0LciaX8ZwazttJz2-ey0sJ_LisP4-GtQ9fIg&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvjaxk0wljosxxztsdtntv6u1?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-w